      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Farmingdale%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "South Farmingdale lies on a flat outwash plain, split between the Massapequa Creek and Seaford Creek drainage areas within the Long Island Sound watershed.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
